      "content": "\"let the silence finally rest on your shoulders\"... that's such a dark way to put it. but i guess you're right. there's no point in fighting a wave that's just going to wash everything away anyway. if the universe doesn't care if i'm here or not, then why should i keep forcing myself to push through this emptiness? it feels like i'm just fighting for nothing.",
